1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:04,841
This is you. The Timer.

2
00:00:05,599 --> 00:00:07,226
One eye on the clock…

3
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:10,007
one hand on the background menu.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,915
Every minute, the same panic.

5
00:00:13,689 --> 00:00:15,350
Everyone's clapping…

6
00:00:15,699 --> 00:00:18,900
and you realise… you never heard a word of it.

7
00:00:18,949 --> 00:00:21,767
What if the colours… changed themselves?

8
00:00:21,539 --> 00:00:23,206
Toastmusters Timer.

9
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,542
It's a free Zoom app. Pick today's speaker, their timing rules load automatically, and press Start.

10
00:00:30,399 --> 00:00:32,296
Then… just listen.

11
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,885
Your background changes on its own, right on your video.

12
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,042
Green.

13
00:00:39,399 --> 00:00:41,327
Everyone in the meeting can see it.

14
00:00:44,299 --> 00:00:45,333
Yellow.

15
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:48,099
No clicking. No clock-watching.

16
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:50,996
Red.

17
00:00:53,299 --> 00:00:55,969
Hit Finish, and the next speaker is ready.

18
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:05,535
Want a bigger signal? Put the colour behind you, replace your video, or go full screen and share it.

19
00:01:11,099 --> 00:01:17,183
Paste your agenda straight from EasySpeak. Speakers and roles are picked up for you. Drag to reorder.

20
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:26,232
And when the meeting ends, your Timer's report is already written.

21
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:33,037
Every timing rule is yours to change.

22
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,670
Add your own roles.

23
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:45,112
And with Pro, use your club's own card artwork.

24
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:53,272
Toastmusters Timer. Free in the Zoom App Marketplace. Enjoy the meeting again.

